% Direct search should take <= 2^(1+4 = 5) iterations.
% Non-valid-optimised search takes 24 iterations.
% Function result optimisation does not improve upon this.
% Connected components optimisation takes 21 iterations.
% Searching for only assumptions takes 14 iterations and scores 0.8.
% Searching for disjoint assumptions takes 7 iterations and scores 0.4.

cnf / containment_is_transitive :
    ( ~ subset(X,Y)
    | ~ subset(Y,Z)
    | subset(X,Z) )